{"page":85,"width":1904,"height":2447,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 I 데이터 모일랑의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":198,"y":111,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"I","x":282,"y":111,"width":12,"height":29},{"text":"데이터","x":318,"y":108,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"모일랑의","x":419,"y":110,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"이해","x":549,"y":110,"width":54,"height":31}]},{"text":"3. 제3정규형 .• 엔터티의 일반속성 7설1는 서로 종속적이지 않는다","words":[{"text":"3.","x":198,"y":284,"width":36,"height":39},{"text":"제3정규형","x":259,"y":278,"width":191,"height":48},{"text":".•","x":476,"y":294,"width":11,"height":28},{"text":"엔터티의","x":512,"y":278,"width":164,"height":48},{"text":"일반속성","x":701,"y":277,"width":161,"height":48},{"text":"7설1는","x":887,"y":277,"width":125,"height":46},{"text":"서로","x":1032,"y":277,"width":85,"height":47},{"text":"종속적이지","x":1136,"y":276,"width":208,"height":48},{"text":"않는다","x":1371,"y":276,"width":132,"height":47}]},{"text":"[그림 1 •2丕1 모텔의 주문엔터티를 살펴보자. 고객번호는 주문번호에 종속적이고, 고객명은 고객번호에 종속적","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":236,"y":393,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"1","x":326,"y":395,"width":13,"height":28},{"text":"•2丕1","x":348,"y":394,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"모텔의","x":422,"y":392,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"주문엔터티를","x":523,"y":392,"width":174,"height":33},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":710,"y":390,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"고객번호는","x":845,"y":390,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"주문번호에","x":1002,"y":390,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"종속적이고,","x":1161,"y":389,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"고객명은","x":1330,"y":388,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"고객번호에","x":1464,"y":389,"width":153,"height":34},{"text":"종속적","x":1632,"y":390,"width":93,"height":34}]},{"text":"이다. 이는 \u0027고객명이 주문번호에 종속적\u0027임을 의미한다. 이것을 이행적 6-4(Transitive Dependency)이라 하고,","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":198,"y":448,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"이는","x":281,"y":447,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027고객명이","x":350,"y":446,"width":125,"height":33},{"text":"주문번호에","x":490,"y":445,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"종속적\u0027임을","x":648,"y":444,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"의미한다.","x":811,"y":443,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"이것을","x":950,"y":443,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"이행적","x":1050,"y":443,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"6-4(Transitive","x":1147,"y":443,"width":218,"height":36},{"text":"Dependency)이라","x":1379,"y":443,"width":265,"height":39},{"text":"하고,","x":1656,"y":445,"width":72,"height":37}]},{"text":"이행적 종-속을 배제하는 것을 제3정규형이라고 한다. 본 속성들의 함수적 종속성을 표기하면 [그림 1-2-기과 같다.","words":[{"text":"이행적","x":198,"y":501,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"종-속을","x":298,"y":501,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"배제하는","x":398,"y":499,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"것을","x":528,"y":498,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"제3정규형이라고","x":599,"y":497,"width":216,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":825,"y":496,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"본","x":904,"y":497,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"속성들의","x":945,"y":496,"width":113,"height":35},{"text":"함수적","x":1072,"y":496,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"종속성을","x":1170,"y":496,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"표기하면","x":1301,"y":496,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"[그림","x":1434,"y":496,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"1-2-기과","x":1525,"y":497,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"같다.","x":1656,"y":497,"width":71,"height":34}]},{"text":"주문번호 “ 고객번호 이고 고객번호 고객명 이면 주문번호 고객명 이다.","words":[{"text":"주문번호","x":457,"y":647,"width":109,"height":30},{"text":"“","x":579,"y":654,"width":30,"height":15},{"text":"고객번호","x":623,"y":647,"width":107,"height":29},{"text":"이고","x":743,"y":646,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"고객번호","x":811,"y":647,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"고객명","x":973,"y":645,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"이면","x":1067,"y":645,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"주문번호","x":1134,"y":645,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"고객명","x":1301,"y":645,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"이다.","x":1399,"y":645,"width":62,"height":31}]},{"text":"[그림 I-2-기 이행 종속성","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":784,"y":737,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"I-2-기","x":874,"y":737,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"이행","x":978,"y":736,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"종속성","x":1049,"y":736,"width":81,"height":32}]},{"text":"고객번호와 고객명 모두 주문번호에 종속하여 제2정규형은 만족하였으나, 고객명이 식별자가 아닌 일반속성에","words":[{"text":"고객번호와","x":236,"y":844,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"고객명","x":400,"y":844,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"모두","x":502,"y":846,"width":62,"height":31},{"text":"주문번호에","x":574,"y":844,"width":147,"height":34},{"text":"종속하여","x":734,"y":843,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"제2정규형은","x":864,"y":843,"width":162,"height":34},{"text":"만족하였으나,","x":1038,"y":843,"width":183,"height":37},{"text":"고객명이","x":1236,"y":844,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"식별자가","x":1372,"y":845,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"아닌","x":1503,"y":843,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"일반속성에","x":1578,"y":843,"width":151,"height":34}]},{"text":"종속적인 제3정규형 위배에 해당한다. 해당 모델에서 문제점을 생각해보자.","words":[{"text":"종속적인","x":201,"y":900,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"제3정규형","x":338,"y":898,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"위배에","x":489,"y":899,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"해당한다.","x":593,"y":898,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"해당","x":736,"y":898,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"모델에서","x":810,"y":897,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"문제점을","x":942,"y":898,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"생각해보자.","x":1075,"y":897,"width":154,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 만일 고객이 이름을 바꿔 고객명이 변경되었다면, 주문 엔터티에 고객명을 전부 갱신해야 한다. 이는 주문과는","words":[{"text":"•","x":240,"y":1018,"width":12,"height":10},{"text":"만일","x":268,"y":1006,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"고객이","x":340,"y":1005,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"이름을","x":441,"y":1005,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"바꿔","x":539,"y":1005,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"고객명이","x":608,"y":1005,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"변경되었다면,","x":737,"y":1004,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"주문","x":928,"y":1006,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"엔터티에","x":999,"y":1003,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"고객명을","x":1124,"y":1004,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"전부","x":1254,"y":1005,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"갱신해야","x":1326,"y":1006,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":1455,"y":1006,"width":66,"height":32},{"text":"이는","x":1537,"y":1006,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"주문과는","x":1608,"y":1006,"width":123,"height":33}]},{"text":"전혀 연관 없는 트랜책션이다.","words":[{"text":"전혀","x":270,"y":1059,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"연관","x":346,"y":1059,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"없는","x":420,"y":1059,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"트랜책션이다.","x":494,"y":1058,"width":186,"height":33}]},{"text":"• 데이터 중복으로 인해 발생하는 문제는 성능 부하 및 정합성 오류로 제 2차정규형과 동일하다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":242,"y":1125,"width":12,"height":10},{"text":"데이터","x":272,"y":1112,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"중복으로","x":378,"y":1112,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"인해","x":514,"y":1112,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"발생하는","x":589,"y":1112,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"문제는","x":721,"y":1111,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"성능","x":825,"y":1111,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"부하","x":898,"y":1111,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"및","x":974,"y":1111,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"정합성","x":1018,"y":1111,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"오류로","x":1118,"y":1113,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"제","x":1223,"y":1111,"width":28,"height":33},{"text":"2차정규형과","x":1269,"y":1111,"width":168,"height":35},{"text":"동일하다.","x":1451,"y":1112,"width":128,"height":34}]},{"text":"고객명 \u0027정세준에서 \u0027정우진으로 변경되었다면 주문 엔터티의 \u0027정세준이라는 고객명을 찾아 \u0027정우진으로 변경해","words":[{"text":"고객명","x":242,"y":1219,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"\u0027정세준에서","x":342,"y":1218,"width":157,"height":34},{"text":"\u0027정우진으로","x":512,"y":1218,"width":162,"height":33},{"text":"변경되었다면","x":685,"y":1217,"width":171,"height":35},{"text":"주문","x":869,"y":1221,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"엔터티의","x":940,"y":1218,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"\u0027정세준이라는","x":1064,"y":1218,"width":189,"height":33},{"text":"고객명을","x":1262,"y":1219,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"찾아","x":1394,"y":1218,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"\u0027정우진으로","x":1462,"y":1219,"width":165,"height":34},{"text":"변경해","x":1640,"y":1219,"width":88,"height":34}]},{"text":"주어야 한다. 이때 \u0027정세준\u0027 고객이 주문한 내역이 많다면 성능 부하와 특정 시점에 발생하는 정합성 문제를 내재하고","words":[{"text":"주어야","x":204,"y":1273,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":304,"y":1273,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"이때","x":384,"y":1272,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027정세준\u0027","x":452,"y":1272,"width":99,"height":33},{"text":"고객이","x":562,"y":1273,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"주문한","x":661,"y":1272,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"내역이","x":758,"y":1272,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"많다면","x":856,"y":1272,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"성능","x":952,"y":1272,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"부하와","x":1018,"y":1272,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"특정","x":1115,"y":1272,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"시점에","x":1186,"y":1271,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"발생하는","x":1284,"y":1272,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"정합성","x":1412,"y":1272,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"문제를","x":1509,"y":1273,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"내재하고","x":1611,"y":1272,"width":120,"height":33}]},{"text":"있는 것이다. 중요한 것은 고객명 변경으로 인해 발생되는 트랜잭션은 주문과는 전혀 상관없는 트랜잭션이다.","words":[{"text":"있는","x":206,"y":1326,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":282,"y":1325,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"중요한","x":395,"y":1325,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"것은","x":504,"y":1325,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"고객명","x":578,"y":1325,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"변경으로","x":683,"y":1325,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"인해","x":818,"y":1325,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"발생되는","x":891,"y":1325,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"트랜잭션은","x":1022,"y":1325,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"주문과는","x":1185,"y":1326,"width":123,"height":33},{"text":"전혀","x":1322,"y":1325,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"상관없는","x":1397,"y":1325,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"트랜잭션이다.","x":1532,"y":1325,"width":197,"height":34}]},{"text":"즉 주문과 관계없는 트랜잭션을 주문 엔터티가 받을 이유는 없다. 혹 고객명이 변경되는 일은 흔하지 않다라고","words":[{"text":"즉","x":205,"y":1379,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"주문과","x":250,"y":1378,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"관계없는","x":355,"y":1377,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"트랜잭션을","x":489,"y":1377,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"주문","x":653,"y":1380,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"엔터티가","x":727,"y":1378,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"받을","x":859,"y":1378,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"이유는","x":932,"y":1378,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"없다.","x":1033,"y":1378,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"혹","x":1114,"y":1378,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"고객명이","x":1158,"y":1379,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"변경되는","x":1293,"y":1379,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"일은","x":1427,"y":1379,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"흔하지","x":1500,"y":1379,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"않다라고","x":1606,"y":1378,"width":125,"height":34}]},{"text":"생각한다면, 고객명이 아니라 고객주소라고 생각해보자. 고객주소는 고객명보다는 더 자주 변경될 수 있다 고객주소도","words":[{"text":"생각한다면,","x":206,"y":1430,"width":149,"height":37},{"text":"고객명이","x":368,"y":1431,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"아니라","x":494,"y":1430,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"고객주소라고","x":592,"y":1431,"width":169,"height":35},{"text":"생각해보자.","x":772,"y":1432,"width":145,"height":34},{"text":"고객주소는","x":929,"y":1431,"width":140,"height":33},{"text":"고객명보다는","x":1077,"y":1432,"width":172,"height":33},{"text":"더","x":1259,"y":1432,"width":26,"height":33},{"text":"자주","x":1298,"y":1432,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"변경될","x":1368,"y":1433,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1463,"y":1434,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"있다","x":1504,"y":1432,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"고객주소도","x":1581,"y":1432,"width":150,"height":34}]},{"text":"흔하지 않은 경우라면 고객별명은 어떠한가? 별명은 언제든지 하루에도 수십번씩 변경될 수 있다. 본 모델은 초심자도","words":[{"text":"흔하지","x":206,"y":1484,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"않은","x":304,"y":1483,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"경우라면","x":374,"y":1484,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"고객별명은","x":508,"y":1485,"width